If your child suffers from video game addiction&nbsp; &mdash; including Fortnite addiction or Roblox addiction &mdash; you may be able to take legal action. Gamers 18 to 22 may also qualify.

Learn more: Video Game Addiction Lawsuit

Anyone who has used&nbsp; 7-OH kratom products and suffered a serious injury, such as overdose, heart attack or addiction, may be able to take legal action.

